+    // Better to use the well-known trick: for row-major matrices X and Y, X * Y^T can be computed as cublasSgemm(handle, CUBLAS_OP_T, CUBLAS_OP_N, out_features, batch, in_features, &alpha, Y, out_features, X, in_features, &beta, C, out_features). Let's verify.
